   "subject": "why it's not enough to scan values of (simple) Rhat blindly",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nhere&#39;s my cautionary note for the day ...</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nSometimes the simple Rhat, as computed by many software including JAGS when running it with jagsUI, can be really misleading as a convergence criterion, as these plots show:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<img style=\"max-width:732px\" size=\"252037\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/hmecology/attach/a482ae3acca51/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nSolution: always check out at least some traceplots. Or (as Matt H. would argue), use more refined versions of Rhat such as split-chain Rhat ...</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
